<title>SRI LANKA: Sri Lanka's Merchant dips on poor result.</title>
<headline>Sri Lanka's Merchant dips on poor result.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Merchant Bank of Sri Lanka Ltd shed 4.65 percent or one rupee to 20.50 in early Tuesday trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;Some retailers are selling the share after first quarter 1997 results showed the bank's losses had risen,&quot; said a local broker.</p>
<p>Merchant Bank reported losses of 42.21 million rupees for the three months to March 31, 1997, compared to a loss of 37.12 million in the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
